text VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrainerMonsStrongerThanWild {
    "Even if they are the same level,\n"
    "Pokémon can have very different\l"
    "stats and abilities.\p"
    "A Pokémon raised by a Trainer is\n"
    "stronger than one in the wild.$"
}

text VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PoisonedMonFaintedWhileWalking {
    "My Pokémon was poisoned!\n"
    "It fainted while we were walking!$"
}

text VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AllMonWeakToSpecificTypes {
    "It is true that a higher-level\n"
    "Pokémon will be more powerful…\p"
    "But, all Pokémon will have weak\n"
    "points against specific types.\p"
    "So, there appears to be no\n"
    "universally strong Pokémon.$"
}

text VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UrgeToBattleSomeoneAgain {
    "The urge to battle with someone\n"
    "you've tangled with before…\p"
    "Have you ever had that urge?\n"
    "I'm sure you have.\p"
    "I wanted to battle certain people\n"
    "again over and over, too.\p"
    "So, I've been giving these away.\n"
    "Please, take one!$"
}

text VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UseDeviceForRematches {
    "Use that device and you'll find\n"
    "Trainers looking for a rematch.\p"
    "You have to charge its battery to\n"
    "use it, though.$"
}

text VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ExplainVSSeeker {
    "How do you use the VS Seeker?\n"
    "There's nothing to it.\p"
    "Use it like beep-beep-beep, and\n"
    "Trainers around you will notice.\p"
    "If any Trainer wants a rematch,\n"
    "it will let you know immediately.\p"
    "Charge its battery and use it\n"
    "while you're on a road.$"
}
